 =B(2\\pi )+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{2}(36-{n}^{2})} \\\\ B(2\\pi ) & =-{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{2}(36-{n}^{2})} \\\\ B & =-\\frac{1}{2\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{2}(36-{n}^{2})} \\\\  & =-{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{2n{\\pi }^{3}(36-{n}^{2})} \\\\  & =-{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{3}(36-{n}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $B$ back into ${y}_{c}=B\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi x)$, we find the missing part:\n\n$$\ny(x)∼-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi x){\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{3}(36-{n}^{2})}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{36(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{3}(36-{n}^{2})}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365962 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365963 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365964 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365965 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186365964 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365961 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b3e8b6be-52c3-5fb8-87bd-b14fedfa5492" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365962 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi x){\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{36}{n{\\pi }^{2}(36-{n}^{2})}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365962 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365962 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ab86f29f-86b9-5139-b7b9-52289787dff7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365963 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi x){\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{18(-1)^{n}}{n{\\pi }^{2}(36-{n}^{2})}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186365963 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 175921860